SUMMARY:Grocery Shopping for Upcoming Week's Meals
DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Beef: 350 gram\n• Cauliflower: 0.5 unit\n• Chicken Thighs: 2 unit\n• Chinese Eggplants: 2 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Egg: 2 unit\n• Garlic: 3 big clove\n• Garlic Powder: 1 tablespoon\n• Ginger: 5 slice\n• Green Onion: 2 unit\n• Green Onions: 3 unit\n• Honey: 1 tablespoon\n• Jalapeno Pepper: 1 unit\n• Olive Oil: 1.5 tablespoon\n• Oyster Sauce: 3.5 tablespoon\n• Paprika: 1 tablespoon\n• Peeled And Seeded Sweet Pumpkin: 600 gram\n• Pixian Doubanjiang: 1 tablespoon\n• Pixian Doubanjiang 郫县豆瓣酱: 1 tablespoon\n• Salt: 1 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 2.5 tablespoon\n• Silken Tofu: 1 box\n• Soy Sauce: 10 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 1.5 tablespoon\n• Tomatoes: 10 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 5 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 2 tablespoon\n• White Sesame: 1 tablespoon\n• White Sugar: 50 gram\n• Any Vegetables: as needed\n• Any Vegetables Or Proteins: as needed\n• Cooked Rice For Serving: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Meat: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Salmon Or Chicken: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Various Vegetables: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n• Starch: a pinch\n\nTotal ingredients: 42
LOCATION:Grocery Store
